tive_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106117","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106117","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106117.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106117.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-09T16:34:40Z"},"body":"This improves the zoom performance **when you have multiple (previously) opened scripts** in the script/shader text editors. This was done by deferring the expensive `set_zoom_factor` (and subsequent cache invalidation) function calls to only be called when you open a script. \r\n\r\nThis was previously updated **N * scroll wheel spins** times for **each script** you had opened; this was done to keep the zoom percentage in sync between scripts, but is now updated and stored in the script/shader editor plugins instead.\r\n\r\n> [!WARNING]\r\n>Zooming can still stutter on bigger and/or first-time opened scripts due to cache invalidation within that single code editor instance. Further work could be done to improve this.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n|  <video src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d11a10c-b5e1-4fb8-a69d-34b721ac5102></video> |  <video src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b844c9b8-1c00-4fb9-a7da-ba0966adb125></video> |","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https: